ong>HORROR ESCAPE - MADE IN 1HR </strong></p>\r\n<p>--- Game Description</p>\r\n<p>this game was made in 1 hour (Well 57m) and was runnable inside the engine, a couple of tweaks were made so that more people could play the game at a higher fps. I&nbsp;understand if you are disappointed if the game doesn&#x27;t meet quality standards, this was simply a 1 hour project that&nbsp;I will be updating. If you are seeing this a while or a couple days after the release of this project I will leave all versions for everyone to download.<br><br>--- Details about the current build<br><br>Compressed File size: 363Mb</p>\r\n<p>Uncompressed File size: 555Mb</p>\r\n<p>Play time: 5m&lt;</p>\r\n<p>--- Developer Note:</p>\r\n<p>Please enjoy the game, its very short, the first build may not meet standards. I&#x27;m also not asking for payments, and also absolutely 0 ai was used in development of this game. And that kind of reflects on the quality of the screenshots and thumbnail.</p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" role=\"img\" height=\"6\" width=\"12\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_8185486\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Published</td><td><abbr title=\"06 October 2026 @ 13:30 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 6 hours ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/in-development\">In development</a></td></tr><tr><td>Author</td><td><a href=\"h